{"sourceUrl":"https://sise.zstu.edu.cn/info/1122/6706.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:15.677241+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://sise.zstu.edu.cn/info/1122/6706.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>一、工作组织</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>学院成立以院长为组长、分管纪检工作的负责人和有关同志参加的接收应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生（推免生）学院研究生招生分委员会，负责对本学院推免生综合考核工作的领导和管理。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>组</span>  <span>长：沈剑</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>副组长：</span></span><span><span>高金凤</span></span> </p>\n<p><span><span>成</span>  <span>员：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>宁建廷</span> </span><span><span>赵新龙</span>  </span><span><span>童基均</span></span> <span><span>金子龙</span></span> <span><span>张艳超</span> <span>严利平</span> <span>张一嘉</span> </span><span><span>郭亮</span></span> <span><span>许丽芬（纪委书记）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>秘</span>  <span>书：</span></span><span><span>徐文炜</span> <span>蒋彬彬</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>二、拟接收推免生专业</span></span></p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>专业代码</span></span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>专业名称</span></span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>研究方向代码</span></span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>类别</span></span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>学习方式</span></span></strong></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>081000</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>信息与通信工程</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>01通信与信息系统</span></span></p><p><span><span>02信号与信息处理</span></span></p><p><span><span>03智能感知与信息安全</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>学术学位</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>全日制</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>080400</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>仪器科学与技术</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>01测试计量技术及仪器</span></span></p><p><span><span>02精密仪器及机械</span></span></p><p><span><span>03仪器智能化和无线传感网</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>学术学位</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>全日制</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>081100</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>控制科学与工程</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>01复杂系统建模与控制</span></span></p><p><span><span>02智能感知与检测技术</span></span></p><p><span><span>03机器人技术与智能制造系统</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>学术学位</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>全日制</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>085401</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>新一代电子信息技术（含量子技术等）</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>01嵌入式与物联网技术</span></span></p><p><span><span>02图像与视频处理技术</span></span></p><p><span><span>03机器学习与智能应用技术</span></span></p><p><span><span>04光电信息处理技术 </span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>专业学位</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>全日制</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>085406</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>控制工程</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>01工业过程控制与综合自动化</span></span></p><p><span><span>02智能装备与机器人控制技术</span></span></p><p><span><span>03智能检测与物联网技术</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>专业学位</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>全日制</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>0</span></span><span>85412</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>网络与信息安全</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>01密码学及其应用</span></span></p><p><span><span>02数据安全与隐私保护</span></span></p><p><span><span>03物联网安全</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>专业学位</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>全日制</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><span><span>三、综合考核须提交的申请材料</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.本人有效学生证、身份证复印件一份；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.本科期间所有课程学习成绩单复印件一份，须加盖所在学校教务部门公章；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.外语水平证明，如大学英语四、六级考试或TOEFL、IELTS等合格证书或成绩证明复印件一份；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4.大学期间各类荣誉及奖励证明材料复印件一份；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5.在校期间参加学术科研、科技创新等科研活动，提供学术论文、专利等相关科研成果或科研活动的证明材料复印件一份；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>6.推荐免试资格证明复印件一份；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>7.《浙江理工大学招收攻读研究生思想政治品德审查表》原件一份，要求提前由考生所在学院的政治工作部门审查盖章；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>8.诚信承诺书一份（本人签名）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>.《教育部学籍在线验证报告》（来源：</span></span><span>https://www.chsi.com.cn/xlcx/rhsq.jsp</span><span><span>）一份；</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>注：申请人请将上述材料按顺序整合为一个</span><span>PDF，并命名为“考生姓名+专业+202</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>7</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>推免材料</span><span>”，发至邮箱xkjkb@zstu.edu.cn，申请材料和邮件名示例：李四+信息与通信工程+202</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>7</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>推免材料。</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>参加综合考核时，在向招生学院提交上述</span><span>1-6项材料复印件同时，须带上原件以备审验。申请人提供的材料必须真实，若申请人提供的材料不真实，一经发现即取消申请人资格。<span><span> </span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>四、</span></span><span><span>综合考核形式及安排</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>学院成立不少于</span><span>3人的材料审核专家组，每位专家对推免生的申请材料进行客观独立打分，以平均分作为材料审核成绩，考生材料审核成绩需达到60分及以上。学院根据材料审核成绩择优筛选进入综合考核的推免生名单。材料审核成绩不计入综合考核成绩。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>综合考核形式</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>综合考核将以现场综合考核的方式进行。综合考核环节主要包括：业务课笔试、综合面试、外语听力及口语。综合面试是由</span><span>5-7名专家（职称要求高级职称）组成综合考核小组，</span></span><span><span>综合考核</span></span><span><span>小组通过推免生面试表现和大学成绩单、科研成果、专家推荐信等材料，全面考察推免生思想政治素质和品德、专业知识、综合素质、外语交流能力和科研创新能力等情况。每位推免生综合面试时间不少于</span><span>20分钟。外语听力及口语测试根据《浙江理工大学关于研究生招生复试中外语听力及口语测试的实施方案》执行。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>面试过程全程录音录像和详细记录，并由</span></span><span><span>综合考核</span></span><span><span>小组成员当场分别为每位考生打分，平均分即为考生的面试成绩。面试时</span></span><span><span>综合考核</span></span><span><span>小组秘书须认真填写《浙江理工大学硕士研究生招生考试复试情况记录表》。</span></span><span><span>综合考核</span></span><span><span>成绩满分为</span><span>100分，低于60分者不予录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>综合考核</span></span><span><span>是国家研究生招生考试的一部分，</span></span><span><span>综合考核</span></span><span><span>内容属于国家机密级。</span></span><span><span>综合考核</span></span><span><span>过程中禁止考生录音录像录屏，禁止将相关信息泄露或者公布。若有违反，视同作弊，不予录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.综合考核</span></span><span><span>安排</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（</span><span>1）新一代电子信息技术（含量子技术等）、网络与信息安全</span></span></strong></p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>日期</span></span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>时间</span></span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>地点</span></span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>具体事项</span></span></strong></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"4\"><p><span>第一批综合考核时间为</span><span>2026年9月28日</span></p><p><span><span>（后续根据考生报名情况将逐批安排</span></span><span><span>综合考核</span></span><span><span>，具体时间另行通知）</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>8:30开始</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>21-A309</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>考生报到，</span></span><span><span>综合<span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>考核</span></span><span><span>资格</span></span></span></span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span>审查</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>8:30-9:30</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>待定</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>心理测试</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>10:00-12:00</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>21-A318</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>业务课笔试：</span></span><span><br/></span><strong><span><span>新一代电子信息技术（含量子技术等）</span></span></strong><span><span>（（专业综合测试（数字信号处理、</span><span>C语言程序设计））；</span></span><span><br/></span><strong><span><span>网络与信息安全</span></span></strong><span><span>（网络与信息安全）</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>13:30-16:00</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>21-A318</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>综合面试</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>外语听力及口语</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>校内考生体检：</span></span></p><p><span><span>2026年10月15日</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>8:00-10:00</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>下沙校区</span></span></p><p><span><span>（校医院）</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>体检：校内考生参加统一体检</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>校外考生体检</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>--</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>--</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>校外考生将二级甲等及以上医院近三月的体检结果在</span></span><span><span>2026年10月16日</span></span><span><span>前寄达学</span></span><span><span>院</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span>综合考核成绩</span><span>=业务课<span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>笔试</span></span><span><span>X</span></span><span><span>30</span></span></span></span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span>%</span></span><span><span>+</span></span><span><span>综合<span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>面试</span></span><span><span>X</span></span><span><span>50</span></span></span></span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span>%</span></span><span><span>+</span></span><span><span>外语听力及<span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>口语</span></span><span><span>X</span></span><span><span>20</span></span></span></span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span></span></