pan><span>校外考生将二级甲等及以上医院近三月的体检结果在</span></span><span><span>2026年10月16日</span></span><span><span>前寄达学</span></span><span><span>院</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><span><span>综合考核成绩</span><span>=学科专业综合<span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>测试</span></span><span><span>X8</span></span><span><span>0</span></span></span></span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span>%</span></span><span><span>+</span></span><span><span>外语听力及<span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>口语</span></span><span><span>X</span></span><span><span>20</span></span></span></span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span>%。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>注：</span></span><span>1</span><span><span>.请参加</span></span><span><span>综合考核</span></span><span><span>考生提前到达并保持手机畅通。</span></span><span>2</span><span><span>.综合考核各流程如有时间调整，将电话通知。<br/></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span>五、学院招生工作咨询电话：</span><span>0571-86848856，</span></span><span><span>蒋</span></span><span><span>老师。</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>信息科学与工程学院</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>网络空间安全学院</span></span><span><span>）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>20</span></span><span><span>26</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>9月</span></span><span><span>15</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><br/></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><br/></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n</div>\n</div>","textSha256":"dae31f307635abeab5c303a68e5d4b68a1093ce69b17d05d431d4df0e4744f9b","textLength":2459,"sourceSha256":"c4c47a709a6bbc7b1998594ad385ff81d796decc415eea9368905fd5d2c91931","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-8635b7557f80c1c8661d","title":"2026年浙江理工大学2027年信息科学与工程学院（网络空间安全学院）接收应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生的综合考核方案","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:15.677241+00:00"}
